# Two independent guards that both live in the queue.
#
# 1. A pause must freeze BOTH clocks. If the wall clock kept running through a
#    long pause, the announcement in progress would be considered finished and
#    the sim would come out of the pause mid-sentence.
# 2. The briefing chain: PreSafetyBriefing must finish before SafetyBriefing
#    starts, and ArmDoors must finish before either. Each link is gated on the
#    previous one having actually played to the end.

config door_calls=1
library ArmDoors:12 PreSafetyBriefing:20 SafetyBriefing:40
library BoardingStarted BoardingComplete

set hour=12
set battery=1 nav=1
advance 10
set beacon=1 engines=2
advance 5
expect phase PUSHBACK

# ArmDoors is on the air; nothing else may start yet.
advance 6
expect playing ArmDoors
expect not-played PreSafetyBriefing

# Freeze. Twelve seconds of pause must not retire a 12 second file.
set paused=1
advance 60
expect playing ArmDoors

set paused=0
advance 20
expect played PreSafetyBriefing
expect not-played SafetyBriefing

advance 30
expect played SafetyBriefing
